00:12:21,878 --> 00:12:25,256
Oh, come on now, Saki,
don't be such a baby.

248
00:12:25,965 --> 00:12:28,092
You agreed to come over to my place.

249
00:12:28,176 --> 00:12:30,553
You knew exactly what you were doing.

250
00:12:30,636 --> 00:12:32,555
[whimpering]

251
00:12:33,139 --> 00:12:34,557
No, I…

252
00:12:34,640 --> 00:12:37,143
[suspenseful music]

253
00:12:37,935 --> 00:12:39,228
[Saki] I don't want to…

254
00:12:40,771 --> 00:12:42,523
-I just came here to study!
-[Mori grunts]

255
00:12:43,149 --> 00:12:46,152
[Saki] I don't like you like that!
This is over!

256
00:12:47,153 --> 00:12:49,238
[breathing heavily]

257
00:12:51,657 --> 00:12:56,078
[Saki] He was not at all what he appeared
to be. He was twisted and gross.

258
00:12:56,162 --> 00:12:58,080
I felt dirty just thinking about it.

259
00:12:59,165 --> 00:13:00,166
[Saki] I need a shower.

260
00:13:00,249 --> 00:13:01,083
[Saki sobs]

261
00:13:01,167 --> 00:13:03,085
-[student] Good morning.
-[indistinct chatter]

262
00:13:03,669 --> 00:13:05,213
[Anzu] Morning, Saki.

263
00:13:05,296 --> 00:13:06,214
[gasps]

264
00:13:06,297 --> 00:13:07,924
Hey, morning, Anzu.

265
00:13:08,007 --> 00:13:10,009
You won't believe my morning.

266
00:13:11,302 --> 00:13:12,845
[Saki] Oh, I will wait till we're alone,

267
00:13:12,929 --> 00:13:14,722
then I can tell her
about what happened yesterday.

268
00:13:15,598 --> 00:13:18,684
Saki, is it true? Did you punch Mori?

269
00:13:18,768 --> 00:13:19,727
I…
[gasps]

270
00:13:19,810 --> 00:13:21,437
'Cause he broke up with you,

271
00:13:21,521 --> 00:13:23,731
he said you have other boys on the side.

272
00:13:23,814 --> 00:13:25,858
And that you followed him
all the way home,

273
00:13:25,942 --> 00:13:27,735
and kept begging him to take you back!

274
00:13:27,818 --> 00:13:30,655
And when he refused to let you
in the house, you punched him!

275
00:13:30,738 --> 00:13:31,739
[Saki] What?

276
00:13:31,822 --> 00:13:34,325
-[sobs]
-[students murmuring]

277
00:13:35,326 --> 00:13:38,246
[Saki] Was this my fault?
Did I lead him on?

278
00:13:38,829 --> 00:13:41,249
I should have been more upfront
about my feelings.

279
00:13:41,332 --> 00:13:45,628
But they don't even know me.
They don't know anything about me.

280
00:13:46,254 --> 00:13:50,258
All they see when they look at me
is my face, my body.

281
00:13:50,341 --> 00:13:53,553
They weren't there.
They don't know what happened.

282
00:13:53,636 --> 00:13:55,263
And now they all think I'm…

283
00:13:57,014 --> 00:13:58,266
It's obviously a lie.

284
00:13:58,349 --> 00:13:59,725
[gasps]

285
00:14:00,351 --> 00:14:02,270
Saki'd never do something like that.

286
00:14:02,853 --> 00:14:05,273
You don't know her at all,
so stop spreading rumors.

287
00:14:05,356 --> 00:14:06,691
[murmuring]

288
00:14:06,774 --> 00:14:09,151
That goes for all of you.
Knock off the gossip!

289
00:14:13,614 --> 00:14:14,490
Hey, Mori.

290
00:14:16,742 --> 00:14:17,660
Huh?

291
00:14:18,744 --> 00:14:22,665
You need to cut it out.
Spreading rumors about Saki's not cool.

292
00:14:22,748 --> 00:14:24,667
She dumped you. Get over it.

293
00:14:24,750 --> 00:14:27,670
But, she's the one that punched me.

294
00:14:27,753 --> 00:14:30,756
Save it. You're not the victim here
and we both know it.

295
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:32,884
You're the one
who ignored her when she said no

296
00:14:32,967 --> 00:14:34,677
and tried to force yourself on her anyway.

297
00:14:34,760 --> 00:14:36,721
-[sobbing]
-[Anzu] Did you think she wouldn't tell?

298
00:14:37,305 --> 00:14:38,806
Never underestimate her.

299
00:14:39,307 --> 00:14:40,808
Uh… uh…

300
00:14:41,309 --> 00:14:44,228
-[school bell dings]
-[sobs]

301
00:14:45,104 --> 00:14:46,814
Sounds like class is starting.

302
00:14:47,940 --> 00:14:49,317
[Anzu] Oh well.

303
00:14:50,359 --> 00:14:51,611
[Saki] It had been a long time

304
00:14:51,694 --> 00:14:53,654
since I cried
in front of anyone like that.

305
00:14:54,447 --> 00:14:55,823
But those tears…

306
00:14:55,907 --> 00:14:57,241
[Saki] Anzu.

307
00:14:58,659 --> 00:14:59,827
Thanks so much.

308
00:15:00,828 --> 00:15:04,749
[Saki] They weren't sad tears.
They were tears of pure joy.

309
00:15:04,832 --> 00:15:06,834
-I had a friend who could see me.
-[chuckles]

310
00:15:08,002 --> 00:15:10,212
We're gonna be together forever, Anzu.

311
00:15:10,296 --> 00:15:11,464
Yeah, we are.

312
00:15:11,547 --> 00:15:13,549
[sentimental music]

313
00:15:13,633 --> 00:15:16,010
[snoring]

314
00:15:19,513 --> 00:15:22,016
Hey Anzu, you're the best.

315
00:15:26,395 --> 00:15:27,563
[Riri] Hey, gang!

316
00:15:28,105 --> 00:15:31,025
How's your break?
Are you enjoying your summer?

317
00:15:32,276 --> 00:15:33,611
[slurping]

318
00:15:34,111 --> 00:15:37,823
And since we're talking about summer…

319
00:15:39,241 --> 00:15:41,077
-Yep! It's that time!
-[drumroll]

320
00:15:41,160 --> 00:15:42,912
Summer festival season is back!

321
00:15:42,995 --> 00:15:45,039
So what are you saying?
Do you three want to go?

322
00:15:45,122 --> 00:15:48,125
I'm gonna pass.
I can't eat any of the snacks.

323
00:15:48,209 --> 00:15:49,585
Too many people there.

324
00:15:49,669 --> 00:15:52,296
You were a little too quick
to reject the idea.

325
00:15:52,380 --> 00:15:53,881
Sounds like fun to me.

326
00:15:53,965 --> 00:15:54,799
Yes!

327
00:15:54,882 --> 00:15:57,093
You both really don't wanna go?

328
00:15:57,176 --> 00:15:58,719
-Oh yeah!
-[Anzu and Tsukasa] Uh…

329
00:16:00,179 --> 00:16:02,223
[Anzu] He probably just wants
to take his mind off

330
00:16:02,306 --> 00:16:04,266
his team losing the big game.

331
00:16:05,017 --> 00:16:06,143
Know what? Let's go.

332
00:16:06,727 --> 00:16:08,145
You two go without me.

333
00:16:08,229 --> 00:16:09,063
-Huh?
-Huh?

334
00:16:09,146 --> 00:16:12,692
[Anzu] We can't go alone! What if he tries
to confess his love for me?

335
00:16:12,775 --> 00:16:14,902
No! Kazuki, you have to come!

336
00:16:14,986 --> 00:16:16,612
The more the merrier, I mean it!

337
00:16:16,696 --> 00:16:18,114
Yeah, you know she's right.

338
00:16:18,197 --> 00:16:19,365
Plus, you deserve a night off

339
00:16:19,448 --> 00:16:20,658
after working all summer.

340
00:16:20,741 --> 00:16:23,577
[Junta] I won't be able to keep
my feelings secret if I'm alone with her.

341
00:16:24,870 --> 00:16:26,122
Fine, then I'll go.

342
00:16:26,205 --> 00:16:27,081
-Ah!
-Yay!

343
00:16:27,164 --> 00:16:28,958
[Anzu] And I'll invite Saki too.

344
00:16:29,041 --> 00:16:30,543
[Junta] Great.

345
00:16:30,626 --> 00:16:32,294
And we should all wear yukatas.

346
00:16:32,378 --> 00:16:34,463
It's tradition and adds to the fun!

347
00:16:34,547 --> 00:16:37,049
I don't know how to wear those.
Can't we just dress normal?

348
00:16:37,133 --> 00:16:37,967
Oh?

349
00:16:38,551 --> 00:16:40,428
Yukata? I want to wear one.

350
00:16:40,511 --> 00:16:41,345
Really?

351
00:16:42,054 --> 00:16:43,931
I got this. Leave everything to me.

352
00:16:45,099 --> 00:16:47,351
[Riri] I promise it was worth the wait!

353
00:16:47,435 --> 00:16:49,937
These are so perfect, Riri! Thank you!

354
00:16:50,021 --> 00:16:52,064
-Yay!
-You're coming with us?

355
00:16:52,148 --> 00:16:52,982
Mm-hm!

356
00:16:53,065 --> 00:16:54,900
You three look wonderful.

357
00:16:55,401 --> 00:16:57,653
[Junta] How is it
Anzu looks even cuter like this?

358
00:16:57,737 --> 00:17:00,656
[Anzu] Hmm,
this really accentuates their hotness.

359
00:17:00,740 --> 00:17:02,658
WATER BALLOONS

360
00:17:03,409 --> 00:17:05,661
Wow, there are so many people here.

361
00:17:06,328 --> 00:17:08,998
-Hang on, do you know where Junta went?
-[Anzu and Saki] Huh?

362
00:17:09,999 --> 00:17:10,875
[Anzu] What?

363
00:17:12,001 --> 00:17:15,963
Uh. Oh, excuse me. My fault. Pardon me.

364
00:17:16,505 --> 00:17:18,507
He'll never get through
being that polite.

365
00:17:18,591 --> 00:17:19,425
[Tsukasa sighs]

366
00:17:20,051 --> 00:17:22,678
-[Anzu] Junta!
-Oh, Anzu.

367
00:17:22,762 --> 00:17:25,931
Uh, come on.
What are you doing all the way back here?

368
00:17:26,015 --> 00:17:27,016
[gasps]

369
00:17:28,017 --> 00:17:29,435
-[gasps]
-[Anzu] Oh no.

370
00:17:29,518 --> 00:17:32,438
[in deep voice]
Don't get the wrong idea here, buddy.

371
00:17:35,274 --> 00:17:36,942
-[Anzu in normal voice] Ryuya.
-[gasps]

372
00:17:37,026 --> 00:17:39,612
Are you two on a date?

373
00:17:39,695 --> 00:17:41,697
It's gotta be a date.
You're holding hands.

374
00:17:41,781 --> 00:17:43,074
-Mm.
-Uh…

375
00:17:43,157 --> 00:17:44,784
No! I was just trying to keep Junta

376
00:17:44,867 --> 00:17:46,702
from getting lost in the crowd.
That's all.

377
00:17:47,286 --> 00:17:49,747
-Hey Anzu, these guys your friends?
-Uh…

378
00:17:49,830 --> 00:17:50,706
Oh.

379
00:17:50,790 --> 00:17:53,125
I know you. You were in our junior high.

380
00:17:53,209 --> 00:17:54,919
Whoa, it's Takamine.

381
00:17:55,002 --> 00:17:56,337
With a good-looking guy.

382
00:17:56,921 --> 00:17:59,256
[Anzu] See? Not a date.
We're all here together.

383
00:18:00,007 --> 00:18:01,509
-[Ryuya] Tonta.
-Huh?

384
00:18:02,093 --> 00:18:03,511
-Huh?
-Come with me.

385
00:18:03,594 --> 00:18:05,513
-[Junta] Okay.
-[Ryuya] Who's that guy?

386
00:18:06,097 --> 00:18:08,224
Uh, who? Kazuki?

387
00:18:08,307 --> 00:18:10,643
He's just a friend from school,
that's all.

388
00:18:11,227 --> 00:18:12,686
You can't be that dense!

389
00:18:12,770 --> 00:18:13,729
What do you mean?

390
00:18:15,231 --> 00:18:16,732
I know I said I wouldn't give up,

391
00:18:17,399 --> 00:18:19,777
but low-key I'm kinda rooting
for you and her.

392
00:18:20,861 --> 00:18:23,948
So step up
and quit letting this pretty boy beat you!

393
00:18:24,031 --> 00:18:27,576
[Junta] Yeah, well, Kazuki's not really
looking for a girlfriend right now.

394
00:18:27,660 --> 00:18:29,954
[Ryuya] Or so he says.
All is fair in love and war.

395
00:18:30,037 --> 00:18:32,706
Besides, when are you gonna tell her
how you feel, anyway?

396
00:18:32,790 --> 00:18:34,708
What? Uh…

397
00:18:35,543 --> 00:18:38,879
Look, I spent three years
without seeing Anzu.

398
00:18:40,714 --> 00:18:43,342
As long as I get to hang out with her,
I'm happy.

399
00:18:44,009 --> 00:18:46,303
You know, in all those girly comics,

400
00:18:46,387 --> 00:18:49,014
the unrequited love
of a childhood friend never goes anywhere.

401
00:18:49,098 --> 00:18:50,099
[gasps]

402
00:18:50,850 --> 00:18:52,852
-Hey, what are you two talking about?
-Mm…

403
00:18:52,935 --> 00:18:55,604
The line for the shooting game is gone.
We should get going.

404
00:18:55,688 --> 00:18:57,106
Yeah, okay.

405
00:18:57,690 --> 00:18:59,441
Bye! Let's hang again soon!

406
00:19:01,944 --> 00:19:03,863
Sorry, my dude,
but you don't stand a chance.

407
00:19:03,946 --> 00:19:06,490
Huh? Looks aren't everything.
She's not that shallow.

408
00:19:06,574 --> 00:19:09,243
[Sota] Yeah, I'm not sure
he's basing it on your looks.

409
00:19:09,326 --> 00:19:10,494
[Ryuya groans]

410
00:19:10,578 --> 00:19:13,455
Who knew it was so easy
to run into people at a festival.

411
00:19:14,081 --> 00:19:17,334
I wonder if any of the kids that you went
to junior high with are here.

412
00:19:17,835 --> 00:19:19,461
Doubt it. It's pretty far.

413
00:19:19,545 --> 00:19:22,756
[Anzu] That's true. They probably
wouldn't come all this way for a festival.

414
00:19:24,550 --> 00:19:25,885
-[girls giggling]
-[Tsukasa gasps]

415
00:19:25,968 --> 00:19:28,345
[heart thumping]

416
00:19:28,429 --> 00:19:30,514
[Tsukasa] I know
I should have brought my hat.

417
00:19:31,849 --> 00:19:35,477
No, I can't keep hiding behind it.
I can do this.

418
00:19:35,561 --> 00:19:38,022
[breathes deeply]

419
00:19:39,273 --> 00:19:40,983
Are you getting hungry yet?

420
00:19:41,066 --> 00:19:42,943
I am! Why don't we get some dinner?

421
00:19:43,027 --> 00:19:44,862
[Junta] I can go for takoyaki.

422
00:19:44,945 --> 00:19:46,155
[Saki] I want a loaded potato.

423
00:19:46,238 --> 00:19:48,240
[Anzu] Cotton candy and a candied apple!

424
00:19:48,324 --> 00:19:49,617
[Riri] I want a lollipop!

425
00:19:49,700 --> 00:19:50,826
[Tsukasa] That's not dinner.

426
00:19:51,327 --> 00:19:53,412
[Anzu] Whatever. Let's split up
and all get our own food.

427
00:19:53,495 --> 00:19:55,331
We'll meet back up for the fireworks.

428
00:19:55,414 --> 00:19:56,916
[Saki] Works for me!

429
00:20:00,002 --> 00:20:01,170
-Huh?
-Uh?

430
00:20:01,253 --> 00:20:03,130
Aren't you Kazuki's friend?

431
00:20:03,214 --> 00:20:05,424
I know, it's Makoto, isn't it?

432
00:20:05,507 --> 00:20:07,343
Yep. And you're Saki.

433
00:20:07,426 --> 00:20:08,802
Is Hosshi here with you?

434
00:20:08,886 --> 00:20:11,889
Mm. We came in a group
with Kazuki and Junta.

435
00:20:11,972 --> 00:20:14,683
Really? You're here with Hayami? So cool!

436
00:20:15,267 --> 00:20:16,769
He's even wearing a yukata.

437
00:20:16,852 --> 00:20:18,729
[Makoto] And I bet he looks great in it.

438
00:20:18,812 --> 00:20:20,481
[Saki] Are you here with anyone?

439
00:20:20,564 --> 00:20:22,816
[Makoto] Not really.
I'm my sister's gofer for the night.

440
00:20:22,900 --> 00:20:25,611
I'd come hang with you guys
but it would just piss her off.

441
00:20:25,694 --> 00:20:27,613
So, tell everyone "hi" for me.

442
00:20:27,696 --> 00:20:29,281
Mm-hm, of course.

443
00:20:29,907 --> 00:20:32,910
[Mori] Ah, there you are.
I thought you were in the other line.

444
00:20:33,452 --> 00:20:34,286
[nervous gasp]

445
00:20:34,370 --> 00:20:36,288
Oh. Hey, Saki.

446
00:20:36,872 --> 00:20:38,540
[gasps]
Why are you here?

447
00:20:39,124 --> 00:20:41,710
You know this chick? She's pretty cute.

448
00:20:41,794 --> 00:20:43,003
Yeah, she's my ex.

449
00:20:43,087 --> 00:20:45,256
-Not bad.
-Dude, I'm jealous.

450
00:20:45,923 --> 00:20:48,342
[guy] So, this guy here
your new boyfriend?

451
00:20:49,009 --> 00:20:50,010
No, he's a friend.

452
00:20:50,844 --> 00:20:52,471
Oh? So you're single?

453
00:20:52,554 --> 00:20:55,224
Don't bother. She's a real ice princess.

454
00:20:55,307 --> 00:20:56,350
[guy] Ooh.

455
00:20:56,433 --> 00:20:58,143
[whimpers]

456
00:20:58,227 --> 00:20:59,728
[Saki] Anzu, save me.

457
00:20:59,812 --> 00:21:00,938
Uh…

458
00:21:02,106 --> 00:21:03,274
Did you hear?

459
00:21:03,357 --> 00:21:06,318
The big potato stand
has five new toppings this year.

460
00:21:06,402 --> 00:21:07,236
What?

461
00:21:07,903 --> 00:21:10,364
-[Makoto] Hey Saki, let's go check it out!
-[Saki gasps]

462
00:21:11,991 --> 00:21:13,993
[somber music]

463
00:21:15,327 --> 00:21:16,370
Huh?

464
00:21:20,791 --> 00:21:23,419
[Makoto] I got the feeling
you needed a way out back there,

465
00:21:23,502 --> 00:21:25,045
sorry if I overstepped.

466
00:21:25,129 --> 00:21:26,463
Mm-mm.

467
00:21:27,923 --> 00:21:29,174
Thank you.

468
00:21:29,258 --> 00:21:32,386
And I'm sorry too.
You lost your place in line for me.

469
00:21:32,970 --> 00:21:35,889
[Makoto] Yeah, it's no biggie.
I can always get back in line.

470
00:21:35,973 --> 00:21:36,890
Huh?

471
00:21:38,809 --> 00:21:41,729
Look! They really do have
new toppings this year.

472
00:21:42,229 --> 00:21:43,397
Wanna grab some food?

473
00:21:44,481 --> 00:21:45,607
Yeah.

474
00:21:47,860 --> 00:21:49,153
[Anzu] Hey!

475
00:21:49,236 --> 00:21:51,280
-You find anything good?
-Yeah.

476
00:21:51,905 --> 00:21:54,283
I guess everyone else is still in line.

477
00:21:54,366 --> 00:21:55,784
Huh?

478
00:21:57,077 --> 00:21:59,163
-[Tsukasa] You wore it.
-Huh?

479
00:21:59,246 --> 00:22:01,790
Oh, good catch!
It's the one you bought for me.

480
00:22:02,583 --> 00:22:03,792
Hmm.

481
00:22:03,876 --> 00:22:04,877
[fireworks blasting]

482
00:22:04,960 --> 00:22:07,004
[crowd gasping in awe]

483
00:22:07,087 --> 00:22:08,464
Hey, it's starting.

484
00:22:10,632 --> 00:22:13,302
[fireworks crackling]

485
00:22:13,886 --> 00:22:15,804
[exclaims]

486
00:22:16,847 --> 00:22:17,806
[sighs]

487
00:22:18,682 --> 00:22:20,267
[phone clicks]

488
00:22:20,350 --> 00:22:23,020
We look so cute. I'm gonna post it now.

489
00:22:23,103 --> 00:22:25,314
Shouldn't you blur
the people in the background?

490
00:22:25,397 --> 00:22:27,524
You can't make anyone out. I'm sending.

491
00:22:27,608 --> 00:22:30,861
I know, let's take a picture together
and send it to Arisa.

492
00:22:30,944 --> 00:22:32,321
Uh, I don't want to be in it.

493
00:22:33,030 --> 00:22:35,324
I bet she will get a kick
out of you in a yukata!

494
00:22:35,407 --> 00:22:37,326
-[camera clicks]
-[Anzu] Huh…

495
00:22:37,951 --> 00:22:39,620
Sorry, that took forever.

496
00:22:39,703 --> 00:22:42,831
You all made it back.
Wait, when'd you get here?

497
00:22:43,457 --> 00:22:44,416
Serendipitous.

498
00:22:45,417 --> 00:22:47,419
You're slumming in here with us commoners?

499
00:22:47,503 --> 00:22:49,922
[huffs]
Actually, the first firework shows

500
00:22:50,005 --> 00:22:51,715
were enjoyed by nobility.

501
00:22:51,799 --> 00:22:53,801
Okay…

502
00:22:53,884 --> 00:22:56,345
-Let me get a picture. Smile.
-[camera clicks]

503
00:22:56,428 --> 00:22:58,972
[tranquil music]

504
00:23:07,940 --> 00:23:09,858
[fireworks crackling]

505
00:23:13,153 --> 00:23:15,989
[Riri] Here we go.
[chuckles]

506
00:23:16,073 --> 00:23:18,367
-[gasps]
-[Junta and Tsukasa] Whoa.

507
00:23:19,201 --> 00:23:20,369
-That was close.
-Uh…

508
00:23:20,452 --> 00:23:21,328
Are you okay?

509
00:23:21,954 --> 00:23:23,914
I, uh, thanks, I'm fine.

510
00:23:24,915 --> 00:23:25,833
Wait…

511
00:23:25,916 --> 00:23:27,334
[Anzu screams angrily]

512
00:23:27,417 --> 00:23:29,461
-You did that on purpose!
-I know you loved it!

513
00:23:29,545 --> 00:23:32,339
-[Anzu] That cotton candy wasn't cheap!
-[Riri] I'll buy you another one!

514
00:23:32,422 --> 00:23:34,341
[Anzu] How dare you make me drop it!
You owe me another one!

515
00:23:34,424 --> 00:23:36,718
-Huh?
-I bought this for you.

516
00:23:36,802 --> 00:23:38,345
What? For me?

517
00:23:38,971 --> 00:23:41,348
Thank you for always taking care
of me, Tsuchiya.

518
00:23:41,431 --> 00:23:42,850
-[fireworks crackling]
-Uh…

519
00:23:44,726 --> 00:23:45,853
Stunning.

520
00:23:47,146 --> 00:23:48,397
Y-- Yes.

521
00:23:48,939 --> 00:23:52,609
[Anzu] It might have been Riri's
annoying scheme that brought us together,

522
00:23:52,693 --> 00:23:56,530
but I really hope we all can come back
and do this again next year.

523
00:23:58,240 --> 00:24:00,117
[keyboard clacking]

524
00:24:00,200 --> 00:24:02,119
[rattling]

525
00:24:02,202 --> 00:24:03,120
[mouse clicks]

526
00:24:03,203 --> 00:24:04,329
[Yukana] I found you.

527
00:24:07,291 --> 00:24:08,792
Tsukasa, my love.

528
00:24:11,295 --> 00:24:13,005
A fanfare, please!

529
00:24:13,088 --> 00:24:15,257
And a big congratulations!

530
00:24:15,340 --> 00:24:17,384
Did you fall for my little trick?

531
00:24:17,467 --> 00:24:20,429
I bet now you don't feel like
skipping the ending, right?

532
00:24:20,512 --> 00:24:24,183
In today's world, you can watch
whatever you want at your own convenience.

533
00:24:24,266 --> 00:24:26,935
But don't you think in that process
we've also lost something?

534
00:24:27,019 --> 00:24:29,313
[sighs]
Don't just let things be! Come on!

535
00:24:29,396 --> 00:24:31,982
Let's go on a super-duper happy adventure!

536
00:24:32,065 --> 00:24:33,984
So I can make sure I get paid.

537
00:24:34,067 --> 00:24:36,236
[closing theme music]

538
00:24:36,320 --> 00:24:37,154
♪ Ah, yeah! ♪

539
00:24:39,781 --> 00:24:40,616
♪ Let's go! ♪

540
00:24:42,743 --> 00:24:43,911
♪ Lo-love! ♪

541
00:24:46,371 --> 00:24:47,206
♪ Here we go! ♪

542
00:00:01,062 --> 00:00:04,733
In today's world, you can watch
whatever you want at your own convenience.

543
00:00:04,816 --> 00:00:07,485
